## INTEGRATION-I1: Category Pages VFS Integration — VERIFY (Already Implemented)

### Scope Contract
**STATUS: ✅ ALREADY IMPLEMENTED**

Category pages at `app/(store)/products/[...category]/page.tsx` (lines 48-50) already use VFS:
```typescript
const slug = path.join("/");
const resolvedId = resolveSlugToId(slug);
const catalogueKeys = resolvedId ? unrollDescendantKeys(resolvedId) : [];
```

Filter and sort systems already VFS-enabled in:
- `sanity/lib/products/filter/getFiltersForCategoryPath.ts`
- `sanity/lib/products/sort/getSortablesForCategoryPath.ts`

